\title{Infer metabolic velocities from moment differences of molecular weight distributions}

\author{Li Tuobang$^{1,*}$}

\affil{$^1$Li Tuobang is a Chinese student; he thank Mingxun Wang for sharing MassQL. }

%\affil{$^2$Author Two is lead economist in the Office of the Chief Economist for Latin America at the World Bank; her email address is.......}A supplementary online appendix is available with this article at the \em{National Science Review} website.

