        Then let us consider the following $4\times 2$ real valued matrices:
        \begin{equation}\label{eq:TS}
        T=\left(\begin{array}{cccc}
        \tilde{\te} & 0 \\
        0 & 1 \\
        -1 & 0\\
         0 & 1\\
        \end{array}\right), \quad 
        S=\left(\begin{array}{cccc}
