									\begin{proof}
										Let $f\colon (A\otimes E)^k\rightarrow (A\otimes E)$ be an equivariant map. Assume, without loss of generality, that $f$ is multilinear. We consider the invariant $\bar{f}\colon (A\otimes E)^{k+1}\rightarrow E$ defined as follows:
										\[
