\end{verbatim}
The function exports results to `BD.dat', which can be loaded in XPPAUT through \verb|Graphic stuff| $\rightarrow$ \verb|Freeze| $\rightarrow$ \verb|Bif.Diag| in XPPAUT.
\end{enumerate}

