  {\bf Case}\ $j=i_-$ and $k\in I\setminus\st{i}$.\quad
  In this case, 
$$\de(K^+_j,K^+_k)= \dfrac{1}{2} \bl \dg_-(\al_{i_-}, \al_k) +\dg_-(\al_k,\al_{i_-} ) \br = (\al_{i_-},\al_k)=
0,$$ 
