where $z_j$ is a spectral parameter for $\tK^+_j$.

By Theorem~\ref{th:DiEi} below, we have an exact sequence
\eqn
0\To\Daf(\Qtp\ang{i}_{z})\conv \tK_j^+
\To[\Rmat_{\sDiz}(\tK_j^+)] \tK_j^+\conv\Daf(\Qtp\ang{i}_{z})
\To\Qt_+(\E_i\tK_j^+)\To0
