Together with \eqref{eq:epiPsij}, Corollary~\ref{cor:qutaff} implies that
$$ \Psi_{+-}(\ang{j\,i^{c}}_{z_j})\simeq\Qtp(\ang{j}_{z_j}).$$

\snoi
(ii)\ We have
