    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=0.85\linewidth]{fig-B2.pdf}
    \caption{ Variation of the resonant frequency $\omega_{\rm osc}$ obtained by calculating the difference as $|\mu_g - \mu_{\rm del}|$ with Rabi coupling $\Omega_0$ by keeping $V_2/V_1 = 0.5$, $V_1 = 1.0$, and $g = 0$. The resonant frequency initially increases almost linearly with $\Omega_0$ and then saturates at higher values of $\Omega_0.$}
