 \caption{\small \em Distributions normalized to unit area for the $pp\to W_h^\pm \ell^\mp \ell^\mp jj$ VBF dipole-portal signal in scenario (A) $\mathcal{C}_B=0$ with different $N$ masses, and for the SM background. We plot the invariant mass of the system consisting of the $W_h$ and the nearer lepton (left plot) and the transverse momentum of the leading-$p_T$ lepton (right plot).
 }\label{fig:dist-SSDvbf}
