\label{sec:experiments}

\subsection{Permuted MNIST}
\label{sec:experiments_pmnist}

\subsubsection{Tasks protocol}
\label{sec:permutedMNIST}

Permuted MNIST is a popular CL framework with unlimited tasks \cite{Zenke2017, LopezPaz2017, Chaudhry2019}. Each task uses random pixel permutation of MNIST dataset. Permutation remains consistent across all task images. We evaluate models on all previous tasks~\cite{Goodfellow2013}. Figure \ref{fig:permutation} shows example permuted images.

