\subsection{Architecture}
Fig.~\ref{fig:architecture_scan_matching} outlines the architecture of Cartographer's local SLAM module, focusing on the scan matching process. In scan matching module, Ceres Solver is the default solver used in the precise pose estimation and optimization phases. Our main task is replacing the Ceres Solver with the g2o Optimizer for the optimization step in scan matching module of Cartographer's local SLAM.

